# Screenshot placeholder

Replace this file with an actual screenshot of the ServerPulse dashboard.

Recommended size: 1920x1080px, PNG format.

To capture:
1. Run `make up` and open http://localhost
2. Register a user, add a server, let metrics flow in
3. Take a screenshot of the dashboard with browser dev tools (Ctrl+Shift+P → "Capture screenshot")
4. Save as `docs/img/dashboard.png`
